:"math","value":"l=\\frac{(p_{0}+\\rho gh)h}{p_{0}-\\rho gH}=\\frac{11}{9}m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）气体发生等温变化，内能不变，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"提升过程中，容器内空气的压强减小，体积增大，气体对外做功，"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -\\sum PS \\Delta x = -\\frac{2000}{9} J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(用 F-x 图像面积或平均值可求)\n根据热力学第一定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = -W = \\frac{2000}{9}J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分） 吸热 （1分，需说明吸热）"},{"type":"text","value":"【核验注】上列热量为原印参考值，按首末压强的算术平均估算。严格按等温过程积分，气体吸热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=p_1hS\\ln\\frac{l}{h}=1100\\ln\\frac{11}{9}\\,\\mathrm{J}\\approx220.7\\,\\mathrm{J}"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--xianyu-jiaoyan-2512-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--xianyu-jiaoyan-2512","source_question_id":"xianyu-jiaoyan-2512-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4b4f3283e7782e05d383995d8b5850815d2bc9950b8d0044325edbb90027fdec","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）如图所示，水平固定管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"PA"},{"type":"text","value":" 中有一质量忽略不计的固定弹射装置及一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块，两者不栓接。管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"PA"},{"type":"text","value":" 右下方的光滑水平地面上停放一辆质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小车，小车由半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.25\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 和长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1} = 4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粗糙水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成，且小车被一固定装置锁定在原地。启动弹射装置，将小物块弹出后，其恰好从 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点飞出并由 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点沿切线方向进入圆弧轨道。已知弹射装置初始储存的弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{p}} = 3.72\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小物块初始位置到管道口