\\times 10^{4}m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{9}{4} < N_{2} < \\frac{25}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":". 装置 1 中应设置 3、4、5 或 6 个圆筒（1 分）\n法2 配速法 带电粒子的运动可以分解为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速直线运动与"},{"type":"math","value":"(v_{2}-v_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速圆周运动。匀速圆周运动的半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac {m | v _ {2} - v _ {1} |}{q B} (1 \\text{分})"},{"type":"text","value":"带电粒子不打到极板，即"},{"type":"math","value":"2 r < \\frac {1}{2} d"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"3 \\times 10 ^ {4} m / s < v _ {2} < 5 \\times 10 ^ {4} m / s \\quad (3 \\text{分})"},{"type":"text","value":"设装置 1 中设置"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"个圆筒，对带电粒子在装置 1 中的过程应用动能定理，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"N _ {2} q U _ {0} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {2} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入"},{"type":"math","value":"3 \\times 10^{4}m/s < v_{2} < 5 \\times 10^{4}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{9}{4} < N_{2} < \\frac{25}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":". 装置 1 中应设置 3、4、5 或 6 个圆筒（1 分）\n（3）装置 1 中设置 16 个圆筒\n动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"16 q U _ {0} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {0} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {0} = 8 \\times 10 ^ {4} m / s \\quad (1 \\text{分})"},{"type":"text","value":"配速法 带电粒子的运动可以分解为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速直线运动与"},{"type":"math","value":"(v_{0}-v_{1})=4\\times10^{4}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀速圆周运动。\n匀速圆周运动的半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac {m (v _ {0} - v _ {1})}{q B} = 1\\,\\mathrm{cm} = d"},{"type":"text","value":"如下图所示，当匀速圆周分运动至1处时，带电粒子打到上极板，随后沿板方向速度分量不变，垂直板方向速度分量大小不变，方向反向，即匀速圆周分运动变至2处。随后匀速圆周分运动再从2处运动至1处，故相邻两次打到板上的时间间隔为"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {2 \\pi m}{3 q B} = \\frac {\\pi}{6} \\times 10 ^ {- 6} s (1 \\text{分})"},{"type":"text","value":"相邻两落点间距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = \\sqrt {3} r + v _ {1} t = (\\sqrt {3} + \\frac {2}{3} \\pi) \\times 